0 FILE 21028 - New York City.ldr
0 Architectural skyline model of New York City built on black base plates, featuring landmark buildings including the Statue of Liberty, a skyscraper with grille windows, a glass-walled structure, a tiered stepped tower, a spire-topped building, and a bridge-like element.
0 Name: 21028 - New York City.ldr
0 Author: Damien Roux [Darats]
